          "text": "LOWER and UPPER change string case; TRIM removes leading/trailing spaces; CONCAT joins strings (ignoring NULLs); LENGTH counts characters. EXTRACT(field FROM source) pulls a date subfield such as year or month; subtracting two dates gives elapsed days. CAST(expression AS type) and expression::type are two equivalent ways to convert a value to a different type — the cast succeeds only when a conversion between those types is defined.",
